{
  "findings": [
    {
      "id": "autoloader-generic",
      "level": "warn",
      "places": [],
      "lines": [
        "The app ships no composer/autoload.php, so the server registers its generic loader for lib/ and looks every class up in the file system.",
        "  A composer/composer.json with config.vendor-dir \".\", config.optimize-autoloader true, a config.autoloader-suffix and autoload.psr-4 {\"OCA\\\\TwoFactorOath\\\\\": \"../lib/\"} makes composer dump-autoload write composer/autoload.php with a class map; the code of the app does not change."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "vendor-shadows-server",
      "level": "warn",
      "places": [
        "paragonie/constant_time_encoding v3.1.3, in 3rdparty/ of Nextcloud 32 to 35",
        "psr/clock 1.0.0, in 3rdparty/ of Nextcloud 32 to 35",
        "symfony/deprecation-contracts v3.7.0, in 3rdparty/ of Nextcloud 32 to 35"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "vendor/ ships 3 packages that the server ships itself in a major of Nextcloud 32 to 35. Both copies define the same classes, and the autoloader that is asked first decides which version runs.",
        "  paragonie/constant_time_encoding v3.1.3, in 3rdparty/ of Nextcloud 32 to 35",
        "  psr/clock 1.0.0, in 3rdparty/ of Nextcloud 32 to 35",
        "  symfony/deprecation-contracts v3.7.0, in 3rdparty/ of Nextcloud 32 to 35"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ocp-removed-soon",
      "level": "warn",
      "places": [
        "lib/Service/TotpImporter.php:52 OCP\\IServerContainer: deprecated since Nextcloud 25, Nextcloud 35 is the last major to have it"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "1 use in 1 file of the public API that is deprecated and that Nextcloud 36 no longer has: the app fails on the first major without it, once it declares that one.",
        "  lib/Service/TotpImporter.php:52 OCP\\IServerContainer: deprecated since Nextcloud 25, Nextcloud 35 is the last major to have it"
      ]
    },
